 2026<span class=\"text-[#666]\"> <!-- -->· <!-- -->7<!-- --> min read</span></span></p>\n         <div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2 976:mt-0 976:flex-row 976:items-center 976:justify-end\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n           <button type=\"button\" data-post-listen=\"true\" class=\"post-action-button h-[32px] px-2 flex items-center gap-2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://every.to/icons/listen.svg\" alt=\"Listen\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold\">Listen</span></button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\">\n           <button type=\"button\" data-post-copy-link=\"true\" class=\"copy-tooltip post-action-button w-[32px] h-[32px]\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://every.to/icons/link.svg\" alt=\"Copy Link\"><span class=\"tooltiptext animate-in transition-all zoom-in slide-in-from-bottom\">Link copied</span></button>\n           <button type=\"button\" data-post-share=\"x\" class=\"post-action-button w-[32px] h-[32px]\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://every.to/icons/x.svg\" alt=\"Share on X\"></button>\n           <button type=\"button\" data-post-share=\"linkedin\" class=\"post-action-button w-[32px] h-[32px]\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://every.to/icons/in.svg\" alt=\"Share on LinkedIn\"></button>\n           <button type=\"button\" data-post-share=\"facebook\" class=\"post-action-button w-[32px] h-[32px]\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://every.to/icons/facebook.svg\" alt=\"Share on Facebook\"></button>\n           <button class=\"post-action-button h-[32px]\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span id=\"like-count\" class=\"text-xxs md:text-xs tabular-nums\">1</span><span class=\"sr-only\">Like this post</span></button>\n           <a href=\"#comments\" class=\"post-action-button h-[32px]\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://every.to/icons/comment.svg\" alt=\"Comments\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></a>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div itemprop=\"articleBody\" class=\"post-body !px-4 976:!px-0\" data-legacy-freewall-excerpt=\"true\">\n        <p><em>TL;DR: Today we’re launching the </em><strong><em><u>Every Agent</u></em></strong><em>, an agentic coworker in Slack that helps you AI-pill your whole company. Delegate complex work, share your best AI experiments with your team, and get personalized Frontier Alerts that ping you when a new model or tool ships and tell you what might be useful for your specific workflows. And you get it all with zero percent markup on tokens: What we pay is what you pay. Try the Every Agent today: </em></p>\n        <div class=\"quill-button\" data-source=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;quill-button-1791301398594&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Get the Every Agent&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://every.to/agent?utm_cta_source=post_button&quot;}\" id=\"quill-button-1791301398594\">Get the Every Agent</div>\n        <p></p>\n        <hr class=\"quill-line\">\n        <p></p>\n        <p>It’s our job to stay at the edge of AI. But even at Every, it’s hard to turn our new AI workflows and tools into team-wide habits.</p>\n        <p>For example, I’ll lovingly <u>clone our editor in chief Kate</u> by taking 30,000 of her historical copyedits and turning them into a skill that lets us edit like her. But getting the skill adopted feels like shouting into a hurricane. Everyone is busy, and there’s no time to try every new skill or tool. What feels like a breakthrough for me ends up turning into one more thing at the bottom of their to-do list.</p>\n        <p>The best solution for this, we’ve found, is working in the open with a company agent that lives in your Slack. It lets you show instead of tell your coworkers about your discoveries. New AI tools and workflows can spread naturally and virally across your organization.</p>\n       </div>\n       <div data-nosnippet=\"true\">\n        <div>\n         <div class=\"mt-10 px-4 sm:px-0\">\n          <div class